flowchart TD
  A[Role entry: main.yml] --> B[Init: init.yml reset facts validate list]
  B --> C[Setup mount and local facts]
  C --> D{Loop disks_partitions}
  D --> E[manage_disk.yml]

  subgraph ManageDisk
    E --> E1[init_disk_config.yml merge defaults validate item]
    E1 --> E1a[Validate device path matches mount_path_type]
    E1a --> E1b[Detect existing mount from disk_part fact]
    E1b --> E2[check_state.yml safety]
    E2 --> E3{state != absent?}
    E3 -->|No| Eskip((Skip provisioning))
    E3 -->|Yes| Pstart[Provision]
    subgraph Provision
      Pstart --> PathRes{Need path resolution?}
      PathRes -->|Yes| PathType{mount_path_type}
      PathType -->|uuid/auto| U2[get_uuid blkid]
      PathType -->|id/auto| I2[get_device_id by-id discovery]
      PathType -->|device| U3[Use original device path]
      U2 --> U3
      I2 --> U3
      PathRes -->|No| U3
      U3 --> LVM{lvm?}
      LVM -->|Yes| L1[lvm.yml ensure VG/LV set /dev/vg-/lv-]
      L1 --> PathRes2{Need path resolution after LVM?}
      PathRes2 -->|Yes| PathType2{mount_path_type}
      PathType2 -->|uuid/auto| U5[get_uuid blkid+lvs]
      PathType2 -->|id/auto| I5[get_device_id LVM by-id]
      PathType2 -->|device| U6[Use LV device path]
      U5 --> U6
      I5 --> U6
      PathRes2 -->|No| U6
      LVM -->|No| Runtime
      U6 --> Runtime{Determine runtime device path}
      Runtime -->|auto mode| AutoCheck{Existing mount found?}
      AutoCheck -->|Yes| UseExist[Use existing device path]
      AutoCheck -->|No| UseFallback[Use uuid → id → lvm_id → device]
      Runtime -->|uuid mode| UseUUID[Use UUID path]
      Runtime -->|id mode| UseID[Use ID path]
      Runtime -->|device mode| UseDev[Use kernel device path]
      UseExist --> FS[Format filesystem]
      UseFallback --> FS
      UseUUID --> FS
      UseID --> FS
      UseDev --> FS
      FS --> FAct[Update fact record with resolved paths]
    end
    FAct --> MountSel[Use runtime device for mount]
    Eskip --> MountSel
    MountSel --> MType{mount_type}
    MType -->|systemd| Sys[mount_systemd.yml unit ops]
    MType -->|fstab| Fstab[mount_fstab.yml posix.mount]
    Sys --> Dup[unmount_disks.yml duplicates]
    Fstab --> Dup
    Dup --> FinalFact[Append fact]
  end

  FinalFact --> SaveBlock[Always: write facts]
  SaveBlock --> Save[Write disk_part.fact]

  E2 -->|safety fail| Fail[[Abort]]
  FS -->|use kernel dev path| MountSel

  Note1[Molecule tests validate: auto, uuid, id, device modes]
  Note1 -.-> PathType
  Note1 -.-> PathType2

  Note2[Idempotence: auto mode reads from<br/>disk_part fact to preserve configured paths]
  Note2 -.-> E1b
  Note2 -.-> AutoCheck

